{"screen_name": "mofumofu_nyaro", "file": "mofumofu_nyaro", "name": "ねこたろ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1904717110477283331/vTBi1Vte.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "自由に活動するためのアカウント。ゆる〜くがんばります うちの子「名ー(ナー)」君のFA→ #ナー君アート　リクエストはこちらからhttps://skeb.jp/@mofumofu_nyaro", "total_works": 2738, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-19T08:27:17.625069+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 7500, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-14T11:08:48.769096"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-18T23:03:24.634389"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-19T10:52:50.858310"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-20T01:48:40.820672"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-21T01:04:04.310941"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:57:32.992527"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-03T16:57:55.920635"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-06T11:56:30.172550"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:56:37.419999"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-18T12:37:36.697239"}, {"amount": 7500, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T17:12:34.361537+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 7500}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5000, "max": 7500}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/mofumofu_nyaro", "name": "mofumofu_nyaro"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/41376765", "name": "41376765"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2739", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b6f87f0/uploads/origins/72989594-41ae-4b0e-8615-22477ad4aad2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=615a3c8728f7823c9d92c2ff5427908a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b6f87f0/uploads/origins/72989594-41ae-4b0e-8615-22477ad4aad2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=615a3c8728f7823c9d92c2ff5427908a, https://si.imgix.net/0b6f87f0/uploads/origins/72989594-41ae-4b0e-8615-22477ad4aad2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fb63922806157e1e8e6bdc39d19fdab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b6f87f0/uploads/origins/72989594-41ae-4b0e-8615-22477ad4aad2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b68995bec9289c1c5efb2884f124660 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再びこんにちは！僕とセヴヴィーはまた一緒に仕事をしたいんだ。今回は、私（ピンクのシルベオン/ニンフィア）がセヴィー（ブルーのシルベオン/ニンフィア）にお腹をさすってあげること。セヴィーはお腹を上に向けて仰向けに寝ているはずだ。グーグルドライブのリンクに「pose_ref.png」というポーズと表情を示す画像があります。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18Ira0TsWkjuNSH135hpAfcjdGc2KDEO5?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18Ira0TsWkjuNSH135hpAfcjdGc2KDEO5?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2738", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffc9acf7/uploads/origins/5a7c457b-9791-4c73-a8f4-61f7b70b6265?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eebaaca39ffe8371a71fe477255de3c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffc9acf7/uploads/origins/5a7c457b-9791-4c73-a8f4-61f7b70b6265?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eebaaca39ffe8371a71fe477255de3c4, https://si.imgix.net/ffc9acf7/uploads/origins/5a7c457b-9791-4c73-a8f4-61f7b70b6265?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94db9a0a72e34e069a85a289a8e6e1c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffc9acf7/uploads/origins/5a7c457b-9791-4c73-a8f4-61f7b70b6265?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcb91bae9cfea43ed1f2b4ccbe22b6c2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！とてもかわいい絵柄です！\n\n今日はポケモンの絵を依頼したいと思います～\n内容としては、優しく慰めるリオルは膝の上で乗っているイーブイをなでなでするという感じです。イーブイはゆるい感じの表情のがいいかもね～\n\n何卒よろしくお願いします！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2737", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1c7349e/uploads/origins/21b41a45-ef33-4788-86a1-b533aec86b35?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc73c7880a6dd7604bbc0be413ed028f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1c7349e/uploads/origins/21b41a45-ef33-4788-86a1-b533aec86b35?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc73c7880a6dd7604bbc0be413ed028f, https://si.imgix.net/f1c7349e/uploads/origins/21b41a45-ef33-4788-86a1-b533aec86b35?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8da6310309dc032f53717e19848e5914 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1c7349e/uploads/origins/21b41a45-ef33-4788-86a1-b533aec86b35?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21da0a248f2f06443ebb148659b3dbd8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, sensai!\nI'm delighted you accepted my friend's commission. Another character of his would also like to submit a commission request to you:\ncharacter reference: https://1drv.ms/f/c/6a8e65b6d252f7b8/EutmO5q5RApIsfNFmPiFXXwBlgkuQva2SQziKcri7NIFAA?e=afmntf\n\n【situation】The black tiger sits on a chair with its legs stretched forward (revealing the pads on its feet). One paw mimics a gun-shooting gesture (see GIF reference), while the other paw is held outstretched. Its mouth forms the “biu” sound of firing (see GIF reference). Simultaneously, its head tilts to the side, one ear twitches in sync, and its tail swings back and forth behind it.\nGIF reference: https://1drv.ms/i/c/6a8e65b6d252f7b8/IQDpfAloYNJrQqYkC4b2yXeYAa6EscWyC6X6wANsTB7vMNo?e=DbNcrr\n\nAnd really love your artworks, sorry for the wrong URL!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2736", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/230aacc8/uploads/origins/1482afbf-0ef2-4898-8f91-454c11907738?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5982bf5fb30b8487c541db424bb4f2f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/230aacc8/uploads/origins/1482afbf-0ef2-4898-8f91-454c11907738?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5982bf5fb30b8487c541db424bb4f2f0, https://si.imgix.net/230aacc8/uploads/origins/1482afbf-0ef2-4898-8f91-454c11907738?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f30e9c6bb4b469695502aee221381e65 2x, https://si.imgix.net/230aacc8/uploads/origins/1482afbf-0ef2-4898-8f91-454c11907738?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2c7c2da19a8003926866a56fef417e65 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2735", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/66dd76cd/uploads/origins/568eb2ad-26bb-4566-8304-43b37a0ff8bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06532e4e6559c3824380b01543a01345", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66dd76cd/uploads/origins/568eb2ad-26bb-4566-8304-43b37a0ff8bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06532e4e6559c3824380b01543a01345, https://si.imgix.net/66dd76cd/uploads/origins/568eb2ad-26bb-4566-8304-43b37a0ff8bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=903b896a8c8e90a94bc54a9841a33850 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66dd76cd/uploads/origins/568eb2ad-26bb-4566-8304-43b37a0ff8bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20ab9f568946b2a5d0267dd443e89691 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、ねこたろさん。\nねこたろさんの絵がとても可愛くて今回新たに要請を申請することになりました！\n私のキャラクターLeciが踊れるように手伝っていただけますか？\n\nリクエストしたいダンスはLemon Melon cookieです。\n参考映像 : https://youtu.be/VA2f1PXuyMA?si=16FZCUtDL9Kat4ML\n\n私のキャラクターの資料は以下のリンクを確認してください。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1y_9oncumUKvwu6nEJXIXmlmRBMVfJr97?usp=sharing\n顔にオレンジ色のチークがあり、お腹にレモンのかけらの模様があります。\n\nダンス全体を描いていただければ本当にいいのですが、ダンスの長さが長すぎるなら半分だけしてくださってもいいですよ！ どうぞよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2734", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/70c6ef63/uploads/origins/a5432476-ec8d-43e5-84d3-9c0dc29e7b23?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc5e6d9adb05b5714c571bbe0f108397", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/70c6ef63/uploads/origins/a5432476-ec8d-43e5-84d3-9c0dc29e7b23?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc5e6d9adb05b5714c571bbe0f108397, https://si.imgix.net/70c6ef63/uploads/origins/a5432476-ec8d-43e5-84d3-9c0dc29e7b23?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b44e7ad3ff288b2858a558e75cc87f0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/70c6ef63/uploads/origins/a5432476-ec8d-43e5-84d3-9c0dc29e7b23?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=382ca5e7acfb4a6a59e0f3e1e1733a32 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2733", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c08b526/uploads/origins/acfc924a-fce5-4db9-a9d0-673168ed80bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5acda08192b016978ed219ecc037ce3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0c08b526/uploads/origins/acfc924a-fce5-4db9-a9d0-673168ed80bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5acda08192b016978ed219ecc037ce3, https://si.imgix.net/0c08b526/uploads/origins/acfc924a-fce5-4db9-a9d0-673168ed80bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a610fee259934c3ccbb44aba3bb73fd8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0c08b526/uploads/origins/acfc924a-fce5-4db9-a9d0-673168ed80bd?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e57fad92b1833461899066527068c6fa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたがバースデーカードとして作ってくれたリモンのアートが、コミュニティでとても好評だったので、これにインスパイアされた彼が歌っているアートをまた作ってもらえたら嬉しいです : https://files.catbox.moe/h84deb.mp4\n\n参考文献はこちら : https://imgur.com/a/limon-Exf9Z7l\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2732", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc7b7f36/uploads/origins/ca158948-3a3b-4656-9828-7b3091a0c3c4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=345de4f9bca99d5c1fdf753216feafea", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dc7b7f36/uploads/origins/ca158948-3a3b-4656-9828-7b3091a0c3c4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=345de4f9bca99d5c1fdf753216feafea, https://si.imgix.net/dc7b7f36/uploads/origins/ca158948-3a3b-4656-9828-7b3091a0c3c4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=433ba536ab62905468325494db84607e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dc7b7f36/uploads/origins/ca158948-3a3b-4656-9828-7b3091a0c3c4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c034d77a6b369cf842779160f27be441 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回描いてくださったこちらのイラストのように、\n今回は【上がミロネちゃん（うちのこ）、下がゼラオラ】という感じです。\n\n2匹を膨らましたイラストをお願いします！\n\n【ミロネちゃん（うちのこ、ミロメの姉）】\nhttps://x.com/sn7xtq6hbmq7ybt/status/1801589404408103161?s=46\n\n【前回描いてくださったイラスト】\nhttps://x.com/sn7xtq6hbmq7ybt/status/1895875773703340304?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2731", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7197cbc/uploads/origins/9efd7583-2041-4eb2-b464-7b8c8d2ed3d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=574e980883a615b6a98cd54df48d9a7e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7197cbc/uploads/origins/9efd7583-2041-4eb2-b464-7b8c8d2ed3d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=574e980883a615b6a98cd54df48d9a7e, https://si.imgix.net/d7197cbc/uploads/origins/9efd7583-2041-4eb2-b464-7b8c8d2ed3d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ad14f3ff230e9a36b7cff29448aaf6b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7197cbc/uploads/origins/9efd7583-2041-4eb2-b464-7b8c8d2ed3d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba5fd4fa6c6587105c6de5405e0ab8f5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "We want to have two characters having a cute, and playful magic fight.  The characters can be smiling, happy, whatever you think looks the cutest! Totally okay with some simplification as well ^^\n\nThe characters are linked below: Lexi is the Female Kobold (Pink) and Saphir is the Male Kobold (Orange)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_PNzhK_g2VOH3jyJ_orf0eotODGP9-va?usp=sharing\n\nThanks so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_PNzhK_g2VOH3jyJ_orf0eotODGP9-va?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2730", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1b52bdf/uploads/origins/a4c545b1-0b45-40fa-9e73-7d3001c6c390?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af0fd3a37fe83960710d3317d177058c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d1b52bdf/uploads/origins/a4c545b1-0b45-40fa-9e73-7d3001c6c390?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af0fd3a37fe83960710d3317d177058c, https://si.imgix.net/d1b52bdf/uploads/origins/a4c545b1-0b45-40fa-9e73-7d3001c6c390?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d8080421704b27d8571046609d8f8f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d1b52bdf/uploads/origins/a4c545b1-0b45-40fa-9e73-7d3001c6c390?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5748c773468debcc83753421b19a9da2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のファーソナをとても大きく膨らませて、左右に揺らしてほしいです。彼女は幸せそうに、こんな風に膨らんでいるはずです：\nhttps://www.furaffinity.net/view/62785778/\n\nhttps://www.furaffinity.net/view/60803561/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2729", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/71112343/uploads/origins/e716fa4f-d22c-43cb-80c8-0e3f9b6d577e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a4715af33415ff8e580bbc59c653750", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/71112343/uploads/origins/e716fa4f-d22c-43cb-80c8-0e3f9b6d577e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a4715af33415ff8e580bbc59c653750, https://si.imgix.net/71112343/uploads/origins/e716fa4f-d22c-43cb-80c8-0e3f9b6d577e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87493f53104baa43e826e6ac386b5f31 2x, https://si.imgix.net/71112343/uploads/origins/e716fa4f-d22c-43cb-80c8-0e3f9b6d577e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc758e2d38a8d8843a737b2ca50c5507 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクターが普段の姿と、大きな目と大きな帽子、そして燃えるような紫色の尻尾を持つもう一つの姿に切り替わるところを描いていただけないでしょうか。彼らは普通に立っていて、紫色の炎のフラッシュで切り替わる。これで大丈夫だといいのだが！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iqPZcTXZKoKu0qMhpFMr7WARIzM1DYpb", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mofumofu_nyaro/works/2728", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5d67dc0/uploads/origins/9573a457-20e7-4782-a3f8-d654b5d75ea0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=623547da882b3b80c2c166f5275061df", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e5d67dc0/uploads/origins/9573a457-20e7-4782-a3f8-d654b5d75ea0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=623547da882b3b80c2c166f5275061df, https://si.imgix.net/e5d67dc0/uploads/origins/9573a457-20e7-4782-a3f8-d654b5d75ea0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80c10c94423f554d0eb2855b0afccdbf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e5d67dc0/uploads/origins/9573a457-20e7-4782-a3f8-d654b5d75ea0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=2